#. Explains the deliberate SMTP port 25 exception to the VPN kill switch, that IPv6 is routed through the tunnel, and the encrypted SMTP behavior.
msgctxt "kill_switch_exception_smtp_detail"
msgid "While the VPN is connected, IPv6 is routed through URnetwork like IPv4. Outbound SMTP on TCP port 25 bypasses the VPN, even when the kill switch is on, which may expose your local public IP to those mail servers. SMTP on ports 465 and 587 stays in the VPN and must establish TLS."
msgstr "VPN ikiwa imeunganishwa, IPv6 hupitishwa kupitia URnetwork kama IPv4. SMTP inayotoka kwenye mlango wa TCP 25 hupita nje ya VPN, hata Kill switch ikiwa imewashwa, jambo ambalo linaweza kufichua IP yako ya umma ya ndani kwa seva hizo za barua. SMTP kwenye milango 465 na 587 hubaki ndani ya VPN na lazima ianzishe TLS."

#. Explains that, with the kill switch off, traffic URnetwork safety rules keep off the network (such as unrecognized encrypted protocols) bypasses the VPN.
msgctxt "kill_switch_exception_unrecognized_encrypted"
msgid "When the kill switch is off, traffic that URnetwork safety rules keep off the network, such as unrecognized encrypted protocols, bypasses the VPN and uses your local public IP. With the kill switch on, that traffic is blocked."
msgstr "Kill switch ikiwa imezimwa, trafiki ambayo sheria za usalama za URnetwork huizuia nje ya mtandao, kama itifaki zilizosimbwa ambazo hazitambuliki, hupita nje ya VPN na hutumia IP yako ya umma ya ndani. Kill switch ikiwa imewashwa, trafiki hiyo huzuiwa."

